The draft’s central scope expansion is now clear: it turns Yixun’s “10 R + T-dup + Tier 2” into 30 B-F measurement cells before the figure, primarily because the exp_25 collector pairs rotated cells to same-seed θ=0 streams/dumps. I’m now checking whether that is truly necessary or whether the existing exp_10 scalar rows can be admitted through a smaller, explicitly mixed-provenance Tier 3 path.
