worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_07_fa_scratch_claude/fa_scratch_results.md:27:**B-F fa_invariant (8×8 M0-fit; relaunched at the SyncBN-64 DDP recipe; stopped 40k for futility).** Screens 10k–40k plateaued at ~2× the 8×8 anchor's EDT/C50 and 0.15× R@1 with healthy loss. cfg0 conditioning-lift probe at 20k: BF lift T60 −19.0/C50 −2.09/EDT −104.6/R@1 +0.33 vs BV −17.5/−1.88/−88.6/+2.23 — conditioning ACTIVE; trajectory globally slow.
