worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_14_fa_drawshare_claude/plan_fa_drawshare.md:29:   **Evaluation cap is a separate, pinned quantity (re-review 4).** `eval_FLAC.py:1005` calls `invariant_conditioning` with no cap and records the module default (`:590`). **Both arms are evaluated under ONE common evaluation cap, pinned to `64` (the module default — identical to every historical eval in the record)**, passed explicitly as `--frame-avg-max-fwd-samples 64` on every eval command and recorded in every metrics record and the params file, separately from each arm's training cap; the comparison is between training policies, never between eval policies.
